{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Les Sentinelles","Josette Roudaire et Jean-Marie Birbès étaient ouvriers, en contact avec l'amiante. Paul François, agriculteur, a été intoxiqué par un pesticide de Monsanto, le Lasso. Henri Pézerat, chercheur au CNRS, a marqué leurs vies en les aidant à se battre pour que ces crimes industriels ne restent pas impunis… La justice s’est-elle prononcée pour les responsables du grand mensonge de l'amiante ? Que fera-t-elle pour ceux de la catastrophe annoncée des pesticides ?",[4,5],"activism","ecology",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":28,"synopsis":31,"production":32,"characters":35,"roles":36,"awards":41,"tags":3},"Film","FR2017_170","fr2017-170-les-sentinelles",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2017-11-08",2017,"Documentary",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Pierre Pézerat","pierre-pezerat",1955,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[27],"Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":29,"trailerUrl":30},"https://fr.web.img5.acsta.net/c_310_420/pictures/17/10/06/17/04/3770478.jpg","https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x8mpkgx",{"native":2,"english":11},[33],{"country":24,"share":34},"Majority coproducer",[],[37],{"person":38,"role":40},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":39},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
